    "body": "# Fix: `handleIntent`\n\n## Explanation\n\nWhen an intent has no data associated with it, the getData() method returns null. In this case, the code tries to compare the null value to the string \"geo\", which causes the error. To\n\n---\n\n## Modified Method\n\n| Property | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Method | `handleIntent` |\n| Class | `name.gdr.acastus_photon.MainActivity` |\n| File | `/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc-openspec-v2/cloned_projects_sample/name.gdr.acastus_photon_27.apk/app/src/main/java/name/gdr/acastus_photon/MainActivity.java` |\n| Status | `SUCCESS` |\n\n---\n\n## Changed File\n\n```text\n/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc-openspec-v2/cloned_projects_sample/name.gdr.acastus_photon_27.apk/app/src/main/java/name/gdr/acastus_photon/MainActivity.java\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [x] Method replaced in source file\n- [x] Repository updated\n- [x] Commit generated\n- [ ] Manual review required\n- [ ] CI validation pending\n\n---\n\nRepair Pipeline",
